cinque/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joncinque/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joncinque/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joncinque/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joncinque/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joncinque/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":611056,"digest":"sha256:3dde54d202caa2d10514fd58a154df5f26f07643f9f5fd0402ff08084f0cb954","download_count":142,"created_at":"2026-09-23T22:00:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T22:00:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/solana-program/token-2022/releases/download/program%40v11.1.0/spl_token_2022.so"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/solana-program/token-2022/tarball/program@v11.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/solana-program/token-2022/zipball/program@v11.1.0","body":"## Deployment\r\n\r\nThis program is available on all networks.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThis build provided on the release uses [solana-verifiable-build](https://github.com/Ellipsis-Labs/solana-verifiable-build).\r\n\r\nYou can verify it by checking out the repo at this commit and running:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ solana-verify build --library-name spl_token_2022\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce the program is built, it's possible to verify it by running:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ solana-verify get-executable-hash target/deploy/spl_token_2022.so\r\n5e888b294bd1941bfc47107a73d5e40bb24fde0d639f69099e7920ad8b6413d9\r\n```\r\n\r\nPublic verification of the build is provided by [OtterSec's public API](https://solana.com/docs/programs/verified-builds#verify-against-public-api):\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana-verify verify-from-repo https://github.com/solana-program/token-2022 --program-id TokenzQdBNbLqP5VEhdkAS6EPFLC1PHnBqCXEpPxuEb --library-name spl_token_2022 --commit-hash 8867f751c0f69367ba03af4f85510b5611989491\r\n```\r\n\r\nIDL is uploaded with the [program-metadata program](https://github.com/solana-program/program-metadata):\r\n\r\n```\r\nnpx @solana-program/program-metadata@latest fetch idl TokenzQdBNbLqP5VEhdkAS6EPFLC1PHnBqCXEpPxuEb --output ./idl.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Audit\r\n\r\nAudit report for this release can be found at the [security-audits repository](https://github.com/anza-xyz/security-audits/blob/master/spl/ZellicToken2022Audit-2026-09-24.pdf).\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nThis build contains optimizations for transfer hooks and support for memo v4 in the memo-transfer extension.\r\n\r\n## What's new\r\n\r\n- Publish spl-token-2022 v11.1.0 by @github-actions[bot]\r\n- Use mollusk for program tests (#1468) by @febo\r\n- Bump tlv-account-resolution (#1431) by @joncinque\r\n- Enforce CPI Guard for WithdrawExcessLamports on token accounts (#1196) by @bit2swaz\r\n- Interface publish follow up (#1262) by @grod220\r\n- Add allocation-free account length helper (#1231) by @grod220\r\n- Use memo program v4 (#1212) by @febo\r\n","mentions_count":4}
